<SiteHeader page="service-area.html" current="service-area.html" />
<main id="main">

<section class="page-hero">
<div class="wrap">
<p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Service Area</p>
<p class="eyebrow on-dark">Service Area · South Florida</p>
<h1 class="display">Based in Aventura. Across South Florida.</h1>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p class="lead">Onyx is based in the Aventura and Sunny Isles corridor and serves Miami-Dade, Broward, and Palm Beach. Local knowledge means routes, valet, and timing handled without a map app.</p>
<div class="page-actions">
<a class="btn btn-light" href="tel:+17869316699">Call now</a>
<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="contact.html#book">Request a quote</a>
</div>
<p class="trust-line">+1 786 931 ONYX (6699) · Licensed &amp; insured · Miami-Dade Permit #64666 · D-U-N-S&reg; 13-860-0693</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-soft">
<div class="wrap split">
<div class="prose reveal">
<h2 class="h2">Aventura &amp; Sunny Isles</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p>Our home corridor. Residences along Collins and the Intracoastal, Aventura Mall, and the towers of Sunny Isles — we know the porte-cochères, the valet patterns, and the fastest lines to MIA and FLL at any hour. For residents here, this is a neighborhood service, not a dispatch from across the county.</p>
<p style="margin-top:12px"><a href="aventura.html" style="color:#B8912E;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:500">More on Aventura →</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="sunny-isles.html" style="color:#B8912E;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:500">More on Sunny Isles →</a></p>
<h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:40px">Bal Harbour &amp; Surfside</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p>Discreet arrivals at Bal Harbour hotels and shops, and quiet residential pickups in Surfside. The kind of address where an unmarked vehicle and a chauffeur who doesn't need directions is the point.</p>
<p style="margin-top:12px"><a href="bal-harbour.html" style="color:#B8912E;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:500">More on Bal Harbour →</a></p>
</div>
<div class="prose reveal">
<h2 class="h2">Brickell &amp; Downtown Miami</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p>For meetings, client dinners, and roadshows across the financial district, we plan around the garages and one-way grid so arrivals stay on time. Hourly and as-directed coverage works well for multi-stop days here.</p>
<p style="margin-top:12px"><a href="brickell-downtown-miami.html" style="color:#B8912E;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:500">More on Brickell &amp; Downtown Miami →</a></p>
<h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:40px">Miami Beach, Fort Lauderdale &amp; Palm Beach</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p>South Beach and the convention corridor, Fort Lauderdale and FLL, and up to Palm Beach and DJT (formerly PBI). One operator covers the whole stretch, so a trip that crosses county lines stays with the same chauffeur and the same standard.</p>
<p style="margin-top:12px"><a href="miami-beach.html" style="color:#B8912E;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:500">More on Miami Beach →</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="fort-lauderdale.html" style="color:#B8912E;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:500">More on Fort Lauderdale →</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-soft" style="padding-top:0">
<div class="wrap">
<p class="eyebrow">Quick Reference</p>
<h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:24px">Area, recommended airport, best for.</h2>
<div style="overflow-x:auto" tabindex="0">
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;min-width:640px">
<thead><tr style="border-bottom:2px solid #0A0A0A;text-align:left">
<th style="padding:10px 12px">Area</th><th style="padding:10px 12px">Recommended airport</th><th style="padding:10px 12px">Best for</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #ddd"><td style="padding:10px 12px"><a href="aventura.html" style="color:#B8912E;text-decoration:underline">Aventura</a></td><td style="padding:10px 12px">FLL, or MIA for international</td><td style="padding:10px 12px">Residents, Turnberry corporate</td></tr>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #ddd"><td style="padding:10px 12px"><a href="sunny-isles.html" style="color:#B8912E;text-decoration:underline">Sunny Isles Beach</a></td><td style="padding:10px 12px">FLL</td><td style="padding:10px 12px">Condo/hotel guests, families</td></tr>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #ddd"><td style="padding:10px 12px"><a href="bal-harbour.html" style="color:#B8912E;text-decoration:underline">Bal Harbour</a></td><td style="padding:10px 12px">MIA or FLL, either works</td><td style="padding:10px 12px">Hotel &amp; shopping arrivals</td></tr>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #ddd"><td style="padding:10px 12px"><a href="brickell-downtown-miami.html" style="color:#B8912E;text-decoration:underline">Brickell / Downtown</a></td><td style="padding:10px 12px">MIA</td><td style="padding:10px 12px">Corporate, roadshows, PortMiami</td></tr>
<tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #ddd"><td style="padding:10px 12px"><a href="miami-beach.html" style="color:#B8912E;text-decoration:underline">Miami Beach</a></td><td style="padding:10px 12px">MIA</td><td style="padding:10px 12px">Hotels, events, Art Basel season</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:10px 12px"><a href="fort-lauderdale.html" style="color:#B8912E;text-decoration:underline">Fort Lauderdale</a></td><td style="padding:10px 12px">FLL</td><td style="padding:10px 12px">Cruise, Las Olas, corporate Broward</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-soft" style="padding-top:0">
<div class="wrap"><div class="feat-img reveal" style="aspect-ratio:16/9"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="suburban-side.avif" /><img src="suburban-side.webp" alt="Onyx Executive Miami Chevrolet Suburban on a North Miami Beach street" width="1100" height="825" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" /></picture></div></div>
</section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap">
<h2 class="h2">Tell us your address.</h2>
<p>Wherever you are in South Florida, we'll confirm coverage and a fixed quote.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-light" href="tel:+17869316699">Call +1 786 931 ONYX (6699)</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="contact.html#book">Request a quote</a></div>
</div></section>
</main>
<SiteFooter />
<aside class="mbar"><a href="tel:+17869316699">Call</a><a href="https://wa.me/17869316699?text=Hi%2C%20I%27d%20like%20a%20quote." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a></aside>
<YearReveal />
<SiteScripts />
